    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cory Galvin of Jeremy Murphy & Associates is delighted to bring to the market 141 Blarney Street, Cork city.\r\n\r\nNo. 141 is a deceptively spacious mid-terraced property with exceptional city views and a superb south-facing garden. The property is situated in an excellent location, a mere 10-minute stroll from Cork city centre and all local amenities to include primary and secondary schools, bars, restaurants and sports clubs. The property, whilst in need of renovation, offers excellent potential to be a modern family home or alternatively a very good investment.\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of Entrance Hallway, Living Room, Kitchen/Dining Room. Upstairs there are Two Bedrooms and Main Bathroom. There is additional attic storage space.\r\n\r\nFRONT OF PROPERTY\r\nTo the blarney street side of the property there is ample on street parking.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY 6m x 1m\r\nA timber door with frosted glass paneling leads into the entrance hallway. The entrance hallway comprises of carpet flooring and centre light.\r\n\r\nDINING/LOUNGE ROOM 2.1m x 4.1m\r\nSpacious dining/lounge room with carpet flooring, centre light and window overlooking the city. Ample space for dining table and 3 chairs.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/LIVING 4.5m x 2.2m\r\nDual-aspect kitchen/living area flooded with natural light. The kitchen area is compact, low-maintenance and features oven, four-ring hob, extractor, stainless steel sin with draining board and ample storage space. The living area is bright and light-filled and features centre light and carpet finish.\r\n\r\nSTAIRS & LANDING\r\nStairs and landings are fully carpeted.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 2.8m x 2.9m\r\nThis bedroom features carpet flooring, centre light, radiator and window overlooking sunday's well.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 5.2m x 2.4m\r\nThis double bedroom features carpet flooring, centre light, radiator and window overlooking the front and rear. Superb natural light.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM 1.7m x 1.6m\r\nThree-piece suite fully tiled from floor to ceiling featuring shower, washbasin and w.c.\r\n\r\nATTIC\r\nAttic space suitable for use as a home office or storage. Excellent space with Velux window and suitable for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nREAR OF PROPERTY\r\nThe Sunday's Well side of the property must be seen to be appreciated and is an excellent south-facing garden with uninterrupted city views from an elevated site."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Exceptional south-facing garden \r\nStunning uninterrupted city-views\r\nTwo-large double bedrooms and attic space for storage \r\nClose to Apple’ European Headquarters in Hollyhill \r\nSuperb first-time buy or investment opportunity \r\nShort stroll to Cork city centre \r\nYear of Construction: 1900\r\nPrivate right-of-way to Janemount, Sunday's Well"
      },
